PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION

WHEREAS the Unlimited Liability Corporation has been incorporated under the Business Corporations Act (Alberta);

RESOLVED that the initial share subscription be approved: One hundred (100) common shares at one dollar ($1.00) par value each, subscribed by the incorporators;

RESOLVED that the registered office of the Corporation be established at [Insert Alberta address];

RESOLVED that the following officers be appointed effective immediately: President [Name], Secretary [Name], Treasurer [Name];

RESOLVED that the Corporation's banking arrangements be authorized with [Bank Name];

RESOLVED that the fiscal year-end of the Corporation be December 31st.

This resolution was passed by the Board of Directors on [Date] by unanimous consent.
